{
 "__fileName__": "enUS_Text/meta/StringList/Conv_QST_Skov_Prologue00_0031.stl",
 "__snoID__": 2326158,
 "__type__": "StringListDefinition",
 "__typeHash__": 3672216444,
 "arStrings": [
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "MenuLabel",
   "szText": "\"It's good to see you, Lorath. Where have you been?\"",
   "hLabel": 4215274549
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line1.6D03F",
   "szText": "Where have I been? Too damn far. I was chasing leads. Looking for knowledge, relics—anything to contain Mephisto.",
   "hLabel": 1512000330
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir1.6D03F",
   "szText": "PICK-UP LINE: He's tired, feeling guilty about not being there for Neyrelle.",
   "hLabel": 3374887287
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line43.6D03F",
   "szText": "In the end...it wasn’t enough. I just wanted us to have another way forward in case things didn’t go as planned.",
   "hLabel": 3454281600
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir43.6D03F",
   "szText": "PICK-UP LINE: He's tired, feeling guilty about not being there for Neyrelle.",
   "hLabel": 505041741
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line5.BAE4",
   "szText": "They didn’t. We could have used you in Nahantu.",
   "hLabel": 3718003623
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line3.6D03F",
   "szText": "I know how it turned out. The soulstone. Mephisto taking on the guise of Akarat.",
   "hLabel": 4094936268
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir3.6D03F",
   "szText": "PICK-UP LINE: He's tired, feeling guilty about not being there for Neyrelle.",
   "hLabel": 1662855929
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line15.BAE4",
   "szText": "Neyrelle told you?",
   "hLabel": 1776443800
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir15.BAE4",
   "szText": "Curious",
   "hLabel": 3639330757
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line23.6D03F",
   "szText": "In a way, yes. That’s…why I’ve been looking for you. She sent me a letter.",
   "hLabel": 4116741566
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir23.6D03F",
   "szText": "PICK-UP LINE: He's tired, feeling guilty about not being there for Neyrelle.",
   "hLabel": 1167501707
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line27.6D03F",
   "szText": "There was one for you too. Here.",
   "hLabel": 692678850
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir27.6D03F",
   "szText": "Getting choked up. He knows Neyrelle is dead, and he knows the moment is coming where he has to reveal this truth.",
   "hLabel": 2038406287
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line25.BAE4",
   "szText": "Your hand is trembling.",
   "hLabel": 3067911769
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir25.BAE4",
   "szText": "A hint of concern creeps in.",
   "hLabel": 635831430
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line11.6D03F",
   "szText": "Just…read the letter.",
   "hLabel": 1865035611
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir11.6D03F",
   "szText": "Getting choked up. He knows Neyrelle is dead, and he knows the moment is coming where he has to reveal this truth.",
   "hLabel": 3210763048
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line29.6DE47",
   "szText": "Hello, my friend. I wondered what I would write to you if this moment ever came. I thought about sharing my research, the things I had discovered.",
   "hLabel": 3275672491
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir29.6DE47",
   "szText": "Calm, at peace",
   "hLabel": 326432632
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line33.6DE47",
   "szText": "But a pigeon can only carry so many words, and what I want to say most is this: Thank you for believing in me, even when I didn’t believe in myself.",
   "hLabel": 3785569286
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir33.6DE47",
   "szText": "Calm, at peace",
   "hLabel": 836329427
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line35.6DE47",
   "szText": "Thank you for giving me hope.",
   "hLabel": 2073537928
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir35.6DE47",
   "szText": "Calm, at peace",
   "hLabel": 3419265365
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line37.BAE4",
   "szText": "Why did she send this? Where is she?",
   "hLabel": 142683228
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir37.BAE4",
   "szText": "Concerned. Getting the sense something is wrong.",
   "hLabel": 2005570185
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line17.6D03F",
   "szText": "Not far.",
   "hLabel": 1023908833
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir17.6D03F",
   "szText": "Somber",
   "hLabel": 2369636270
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line21.6D03F",
   "szText": "But…we should find a place to sit down, and we can—",
   "hLabel": 1533805628
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir21.6D03F",
   "szText": "Somber",
   "hLabel": 2879533065
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line39.BAE4",
   "szText": "Just tell me what is happening.",
   "hLabel": 220954014
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir39.BAE4",
   "szText": "Firm",
   "hLabel": 2083840971
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line41.6D03F",
   "szText": "It’s better if I show you. Come with me.",
   "hLabel": 871345662
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir41.6D03F",
   "szText": "Somber",
   "hLabel": 2217073099
  }
 ],
 "ptMapStringTable": "0"
}
